{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22089","headline":"新乐府 天可度\t恶诈人也 · 白居易","name":"新乐府 天可度\t恶诈人也","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天可度，地可量，唯有人心不可防。\n但见丹诚赤如血，谁知僞言巧似簧。\n劝君掩鼻君莫掩，使君夫妇爲参商。\n劝君掇蠭君莫掇，使君父子成豺狼。\n海底鱼兮天上鸟，高可射兮深可钓。\n唯有人心相对时，咫尺之间不能料。\n君不见李义府之辈笑欣欣，笑中有刀潜杀人。\n阴阳神变皆可测，不测人间笑是瞋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22089.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22089","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}